{"v":4,"catch":"1987年發售的勇者鬥惡龍系列第二款作品。\n自本作起引進了隊伍制，能夠最多3人一同展開冒險。","desc":"-故事劇情-\n前作後經過100年，\n過去勇者拯救了阿雷夫加爾德之後，\n繼承其血統的子孫建立了3個新國家。\n此時卻出現了大神官哈貢，\n從黑暗世界喚出大群怪物，\n欲將世界導向毀滅！\n蘿蕾西亞國的年輕王子為了討伐哈貢，\n便啟程尋找同樣身懷勇者血統的2位夥伴。","publisher":"SQUARE ENIX","release":"2025-12-04","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/02bd9c41374f8275bb6151d3119a4ee665f18be1174d0b40e9bd3f6540988b8a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d0c457c78c6a475f6bbc26542aea0e7e925d0712b976773fc3b0fab4f3b1d82.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e7da22e0b86e1a29615d83d9623c83082738f2f18de947d471e1df10abf254fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8fb24612e03a59ee2ae5e318eac62819e164399c28a897efac6509d53cb91b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9abd4c751c0437aeeb4d5ab87c9ad63fa41b5b7b24318a6e55e2dda9f0e56a6b.jpg"],"titleId":"010062200efb4000","dlc":[]}